## TestScenario — Gameplay Testing Framework

Edit `autoloads/test_scenario.gd` to quickly set up gameplay test configurations.

1. Set `enabled = true`
2. Configure the fields you need (starting balls, upgrades, pegs, timer, etc.)
3. Run the game
4. Set `enabled = false` when done

When the user describes a test scenario (e.g. "test with all explosive balls and explosions apply energize"), translate that into TestScenario fields rather than creating new constants or debug flags.
